{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16456","headline":"胡笳十八拍 第十七拍 · 刘商","name":"胡笳十八拍 第十七拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行尽胡天千万里，唯见黄沙白云起。\n马饥跑雪衔草根，人渴敲冰饮流水。\n燕山髣髴辨烽戍，鼙鼓如闻汉家垒。\n努力前程是帝乡，生前免向胡中死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}